>> title: Zucchini Bread
>> category: Cakes & Loaves
>> tags: zucchini, quick bread, walnuts, oven
>> counters: Bakery
>> aka: zucchini loaf, courgette loaf
>> servings: 10
>> time: 1 hr 15 min

Grease a #9x5-in loaf pan{}.

Preheat the #oven{} to 350°F (175°C).

Whisk @eggs{2%large}, @vegetable oil{1/2%cup}(120 mL), @granulated sugar{1%cup}(200 g), @vanilla extract{2%tsp}(10 mL).

Stir @grated zucchini{2%cup}(250 g; not squeezed dry) into @&(~1)egg mixture{}.

Whisk @all-purpose flour{1 3/4%cup}(220 g), @baking soda{1/2%tsp}(3 g), @baking powder{1%tsp}(4 g), @ground cinnamon{1 1/2%tsp}(4 g), @table salt{1/2%tsp}(3 g).

Fold @&(~1)dry mixture{}, @chopped walnuts{1/2%cup}(60 g) into @&(4)zucchini mixture{}.

Bake @&(~1)batter{} at 350°F for ~{55%min}.
